<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the late sale of the following vessels.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Western Bell - (built 1991) 42,003 dwt sold for $19 million  to Japanese buyers.</p>
<p>TANKERS - Troms Producer - (built 1983) 39,742 dwt sold to swedish buyers for $18 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Panandros - (built 1975) 15,122 dwt sold to UK buyers for $1.76 million.</p>
<p>Kota Jati - (built 1976) 19,349 dwt sold to undisclosed buyers for $3 million.</p>
<p>Some of these sales may not be final.</p>
</text>
